@page "/privacy"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<h1>Privacy</h1>

<div class="mu-panel">
    <div class="mu-panel__body">
        <h2>What this site stores</h2>
        <p>Your account name, a one-way hash of your password, and an email address if you chose to give
           one. Passwords are hashed with bcrypt and are not recoverable &mdash; nobody here can read
           yours, including administrators.</p>

        <h2>What it shows publicly</h2>
        <p>Character names, classes, levels, resets, player-kill counts and guild membership appear on
           the rankings and profile pages. Your account name, your email address and your login times
           are never shown publicly.</p>

        <h2>Logs</h2>
        <p>Sign-ins and administrative actions are recorded with a timestamp and an IP address so that
           abuse can be investigated. Session records are removed when they expire.</p>

        <h2>Removal</h2>
        <p>Ask an administrator to delete your account and its characters. Deletion is permanent.</p>
    </div>
</div>
